# jarvis-core machine-local environment (copy to .env.local — gitignored).
# This repo is public: no secret VALUES belong anywhere but .env.local.
#
# Most credentials do NOT go here — jarvis-core fetches them at runtime,
# by world (ARCHITECTURE.md §7):
#   CACC     → vault.cacadets.org        (CACC_VAULT_TOKEN, User-scope env var)
#     - "CACC Core / Supabase" / SUPABASE_SUPAVISOR_TRANSACTION_URL  (cacc-checks)
#     - "CACC Core / Vercel"   / VERCEL_TOKEN                        (cacc-checks)
#   Momentum → vault.momentumsystems.dev (MOMENTUM_VAULT_TOKEN, User-scope env var)
#     - "Momentum Core / Supabase" / CRM_DATABASE_URL                (momentum-crm)
#   CACC mailbox → the cached Graph token at ~/.cacc-graph/token.json (cacc-comms)
#
# Personal-world credentials have no vault; they live here instead:

# Andrew OS (tracking.andrewroach.xyz) — personal Supabase project, schema
# `tracking`. Same values as SUPABASE_URL / SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY in the
# tracking repo's own .env.local.
TRACKING_SUPABASE_URL=
TRACKING_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=
